- Role: A set of permissions that a user may hold, either assigned or delegated.
- Request: An action submission by a user affecting system objects.
- Emergency Mode: A temporary state of the system triggered by administrators for handling emergencies.
- Emergency Privileges: Additional permissions granted to administrators during Emergency mode.

